*** Keywords ***
CB013048_feature_activation_and_check_against_wrong_PLMNs
    [Documentation]    !!! DON'T USE UE RESERVATION IN TEST SETUP !!!
    ...                !!! TC DOES NOT FULLY SUPPORT SW VERSIONS < SBTS25R1 !!!
    ...                The CB013048: Radio Unit Anti-theft Protection feature allows to mark Radio Units (RU)
    ...                with unique codes to prevent stolen units from being used illegally in another operators network.
    ...                Marking is based on the public land mobile network (PLMN) and can be done either with
    ...                a Mobile Country Code (MCC) or with a combination of MCC and MNC (Mobile Network Code) pair.
    ...                If a stolen unit is moved to a different country or operator when it is inserted in the BTS,
    ...                the unit marking wont match the MCC or MCC + MNC codes in the new, different operator configuration.
    ...                As a result, all BTS cells will be shut down, and a fault indicating a suspicious unit will be raised.
    ...                This fault remains active until the suspicious unit is removed and the BTS is restarted.
    ...                      Args:
    ...                              - scf_client_with_security_feature (str): path to SCF file with security feature support
    ...                              - ues (list[UE]): list of UEs from init file
    ...                              - ue_reboot (bool or str): defines whether UEs should be rebooted during reservation and which method should be used to do it;
    ...                                                         i.e. False - no reboot will be done, adb - ADB reboot will be done, ute - UTE lib reboot will be done;
    ...                                                         defaults to: False (no UE reboot will be done);
    ...                                                         recommended value: False
    ...                              - access_point_names (dict[str, str]): pairs of UE serial number and desired APN to be configured on it;
    ...                                                                     i.e. {"HZQN1876BAKC2300264": "5GWROSA",
    ...                                                                     "fe2c6c0c": "5GWROSA"};
    ...                                                                     mandatory for NSA+SA mode;
    ...                                                                     defaults to: None (APN will not be changed on any UE);
    ...                                                                     recommended value: not None for NSA+SA mode or if APN must be changed for other reason, None otherwise
    ...                              - attenuator_info (Attenuator): configuration object from init file of attenuator which will be used during L3 call performed on supercell;
    ...                                                              i.e. ${tl.attenuators[0]}
    ...                                                              defaults to: None (attenuator will not be used);
    ...                                                              recommended value: not None if L3 call will be performed on supercell, None otherwise
    ...                              - attenuator_config (dict[str, dict]): configuration of attenuator ports paired with RMOD antennas which will be used
    ...                                                  during L3 call performed on supercell;
    ...                                                  i.e.
    ...                                                  {"MRBTS-50109/NRBTS-50109/NRCELL-1": {"Subcell-0": [{"antenna": "RMOD-1/ANTL-1", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0},
    ...                                                                                                      {"antenna": "RMOD-1/ANTL-5", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0}],
    ...                                                                                        "Subcell-1": [{"antenna": "RMOD-2/ANTL-1", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0},
    ...                                                                                                      {"antenna": "RMOD-2/ANTL-5", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0}]}}
    ...                                                  defaults to: None (attenuator will not be used);
    ...                                                  recommended value: not None if L3 call will be performed on supercell, None otherwise
    ...                              - throughputs (dit[str, str]): dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                                             it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                                             defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                                             Example:
    ...                                                             {
    ...                                                                 '827736065':
    ...                                                                     {
    ...                                                                         'throughput':
    ...                                                                             {
    ...                                                                                 'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                                                 'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                                             },
    ...                                                                         'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                                     },
    ...                                                             }
    ...                              - protocol (str): data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...                              - udp_buffer (str): monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...                              - cells_distnames (list[str]): list of configuration distnames of cells to be called;
    ...                                                 defaults to None (all cells will be called).
    ...                              - duration (int): duration of data transfer in seconds; defaults to 60s
    ...                              - tput_verification_via_btslog (bool): True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                                                     False - throughput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...                              - ue_network_modes (dict[str, str]): mandatory parameter for SA+NSA setups, dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes
    ...                                                                   e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"} possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                                                   when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                                                   with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    [Arguments]                         ${scf_client_with_security_feature}
    ...                                 ${ues}=${None}
    ...                                 ${ue_reboot}=${False}
    ...                                 ${access_point_names}=${None}
    ...                                 ${attenuator_info}=${None}
    ...                                 ${attenuator_config}=${None}
    ...                                 ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                 ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                 ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                 ${cells_distnames}=${None}
    ...                                 ${duration}=60s
    ...                                 ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...                                 ${ue_network_modes}=${None}

    ${bts_type}=                                    hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                  connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${sw_stream}=                                   sw_stream.get_sw_stream
    ...                                             device=${bts_type}
    config_operations.connect                       alias=${connection}
    ${ues_provided}=                                Convert To Boolean    ${ues}
    Run Keyword If                                  (not ${ues_provided} and bool(${throughputs})) or (${ues_provided} and not bool(${throughputs}))
    ...                                             Fail    Both \${ues} and \${throughputs} must be provided or none of them.

    Run Keyword If                                  "${sw_stream}" > "SBTS24R3"
    ...                                             Try To Set actRadioSecMarking And Expect Error
    ...                                             ELSE
    ...                                             Try To Set tmpParam2 And Expect Error
    Perform Commissioning And Persist Default Passwords For Hindi Feature
    ...                                             scf_path=${scf_client_with_security_feature}
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ${base_plmn}=                                   Get Current PLMN Params
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    Run Keyword If                                  ${ues_provided} and bool(${throughputs})
    ...                                             call_manager.UE Reservation
    ...                                             ues=${ues}
    ...                                             ue_reboot=${ue_reboot}
    ...                                             access_point_names=${access_point_names}
    ...                                             attenuator_info=${attenuator_info}
    ...                                             attenuator_config=${attenuator_config}
    ...                                             ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

    Enable Radio Marking Feature                    sw_stream=${sw_stream}
    Verify RMODs And Cells Statuses After Security Feature Activation
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ${rmods_runtime_distname}=                      Verify Anti Theft Protection
    ...                                             current_plmn=${base_plmn}
    ...                                             connection=${connection}

    Allow Fault 4795                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    Set PLMN and Radio Marking Values               connection=${connection}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                             sw_stream=${sw_stream}
    ...                                             mcc_value=555
    ...                                             mnc_value=10
    ...                                             actRadioSecMarking_value=Disabled
    ...                                             tmpParam2_value=0
    ...                                             skip_parameter_relation_errors=${True}
    Verify Fault 4795 Active                        rmods_runtime_distname=${rmods_runtime_distname}
    Set PLMN and Radio Marking Values               connection=${connection}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                             sw_stream=${sw_stream}
    ...                                             mcc_value=${base_plmn['mcc']}
    ...                                             mnc_value=${base_plmn['mnc']}
    ...                                             actRadioSecMarking_value=Disabled
    ...                                             tmpParam2_value=0
    ...                                             skip_parameter_relation_errors=${True}
    Verify Fault 4795 Inactive
    Disallow Fault 4795                             bts_type=${bts_type}

    Run Keyword If                                  ${ues_provided} and bool(${throughputs})
    ...                                             Execute L3 call
    ...                                             throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                             cells_distnames=${cells_distnames}
    ...                                             protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                             udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                             duration=${duration}
    ...                                             tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                             ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

    [Teardown]                                      Set PLMN and Radio Marking Values
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                             sw_stream=${sw_stream}
    ...                                             mcc_value=${base_plmn['mcc']}
    ...                                             mnc_value=${base_plmn['mnc']}
    ...                                             actRadioSecMarking_value=Disabled
    ...                                             tmpParam2_value=0
    ...                                             skip_parameter_relation_errors=${True}
    ...                                             check_bts_reset=${False}

Try To Set actRadioSecMarking And Expect Error
    Run Keyword And Expect Error    AdminApiProcedureFailureException:*Configured MCC is not allowed for RU anti-theft marking*
    ...                                             Set actRadioSecMarking Value
    ...                                             value=MCC only

Try To Set tmpParam2 And Expect Error
    Run Keyword And Expect Error    AdminApiProcedureFailureException:*The parameter \${MNL-1.tmpParam2} (value: 1) shall be set to 0*
    ...                                             Set tmpParam2 Value
    ...                                             value=1

Set PLMN and Radio Marking Values
    [Arguments]                                     ${connection}
    ...                                             ${bts_type}
    ...                                             ${mcc_value}
    ...                                             ${mnc_value}
    ...                                             ${sw_stream}
    ...                                             ${actRadioSecMarking_value}=${None}
    ...                                             ${tmpParam2_value}=${None}
    ...                                             ${skip_parameter_relation_errors}=${False}
    ...                                             ${check_bts_reset}=${True}

    ${mrbts_id}=                                    admin_info_model.get_mrbts_id_admin
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ${nrbts_id}=                                    admin_info_model.get_nrbts_id_admin
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    &{mnc_mcc}=                                     Create Dictionary
    ...                                             mcc=${mcc_value}
    ...                                             mnc=${mnc_value}
    &{anti_theft}=                                  Create Dictionary
    ...                                             actRadioSecMarking=${actRadioSecMarking_value}
    &{anti_theft_sbts24r3}=                         Create Dictionary
    ...                                             tmpParam2=${tmpParam2_value}
    &{obj_params}=                                  Create Dictionary
    ...                                             MRBTS-${mrbts_id}/NRBTS-${nrbts_id}=${mnc_mcc}
    ...                                             MRBTS-${mrbts_id}/NRBTS-${nrbts_id}/NRPLMN-1=${mnc_mcc}

    Run Keyword If                                  "${sw_stream}" > "SBTS24R3"
    ...                                             Set To Dictionary
    ...                                             ${obj_params}
    ...                                             MRBTS-${mrbts_id}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1=${anti_theft}
    ...                                             ELSE
    ...                                             Set To Dictionary
    ...                                             ${obj_params}
    ...                                             MRBTS-${mrbts_id}/MNL-1=${anti_theft_sbts24r3}

    delta_configurator.set_parameters_for_dist_names_via_delta_recommissioning_in_separate_process
    ...                                             objects_dict=${obj_params}
    ...                                             skip_parameter_relation_errors=${skip_parameter_relation_errors}
    ...                                             timeout=1200

    Run Keyword If                                  ${check_bts_reset}
    ...                                             Check If BTS Reset Was Performed
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                             timeout=240
    wait until keyword succeeds                     20min
    ...                                             5s
    ...                                             Check all BBMODs and RMODs
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

Verify Anti Theft Protection
    [Arguments]                                     ${current_plmn}
    ...                                             ${connection}

    ${rmods_runtime_distname}=                      Create List
    ${rmods_config_distname}=                       admin_info_model.get_rmods
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ${anti_theft_param}=                            Create List   antiTheftProtection
    FOR    ${rmod_config_distname}    IN    @{rmods_config_distname}
        ${rmod_name}=                               Set Variable  ${rmod_config_distname.rsplit('/', 1)[1]}
        Robot Log Step                              Verifying Anti Theft Protection for ${rmod_name}

        ${runtime_rmod_distname}=                   admin_info_model.translate_rmod_distname
        ...                                         rmod_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                         output_distname_type=runtime
        ...                                         connection=${connection}
        Append To List                              ${rmods_runtime_distname}  ${runtime_rmod_distname}
        ${current_antitheft_values}=                config_operations.get_parameters_by_distname
        ...                                         dist_name=${runtime_rmod_distname}
        ...                                         parameter_list=${anti_theft_param}
        ${current_antitheft_values}=                Set Variable    ${current_antitheft_values['antiTheftProtection'][0]}

        Should Be Equal                             ${current_antitheft_values['mcc']}  ${current_plmn['mcc']}
        ...                                         msg=mcc value mismatch between ${rmod_name} and NRPLMN-1
        Should Be Equal                             ${current_antitheft_values['mnc']}  ${current_plmn['mnc']}
        ...                                         msg=mnc value mismatch between ${rmod_name} and NRPLMN-1
        Should Be Equal                             ${current_antitheft_values['mncLength']}  ${current_plmn['mncLength']}
        ...                                         msg=mncLength value mismatch between ${rmod_name} and NRPLMN-1

        Robot Log Result                            ${rmod_name} antiTheftProtection values are correct!
    END
    Robot Log Result                                Anti Theft Protection verification has been successfully!

    [Return]                                        ${rmods_runtime_distname}

Set actRadioSecMarking Value
    [Arguments]                                     ${value}
    config_operations.set_parameter_value           dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                             param_name=actRadioSecMarking
    ...                                             param_value=${value}
    ...                                             skip_parameter_relation_errors=${True}

    Robot Log Result                                Parameter actRadioSecMarking successfully changed to ${value}

Set tmpParam2 Value
    [Arguments]                                     ${value}
    config_operations.set_parameter_value           dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1
    ...                                             param_name=tmpParam2
    ...                                             param_value=${value}

    Robot Log Result                                Parameter tmpParam2 successfully changed to ${value}

Verify Fault 4795 Active
    [Arguments]                                     ${rmods_runtime_distname}

    ${reason}=                                      Evaluate    ','.join(sorted(${rmods_runtime_distname}, key=lambda dist_name: int(dist_name.rsplit("-", 1)[1])))
    ${is_alarm_active}=                             Alarms.Wait for active alarm
    ...                                             alarm_id=7116
    ...                                             fault_id=4795
    ...                                             reason=${reason}
    ...                                             timeout=300s

    Should Be True                                  ${is_alarm_active}
    ...                                             msg=Fault 4795 is not active

    Robot Log Result                                Fault 4795 has been raised successfully

Verify Fault 4795 Inactive
    Alarms.Wait for inactive alarm                  alarm_id=7116
    ...                                             fault_id=4795
    ...                                             timeout=300s

    Robot Log Result                                Fault 4795 has been cleared successfully

Get Current PLMN Params
    [Arguments]                                     ${connection}

    ${nrplmn_distname}=                             Set Variable  MRBTS-{}/NRBTS-{}/NRPLMN-1
    ${plmn_params}=                                 Create List   mcc  mnc  mncLength
    ${current_plmn}=                                config_operations.get_parameters_by_distname
    ...                                             dist_name=${nrplmn_distname}
    ...                                             parameter_list=${plmn_params}

    [Return]                                        ${current_plmn}


Perform Commissioning And Persist Default Passwords For Hindi Feature
    [Arguments]                                     ${scf_path}
    ...                                             ${connection}

    ${mrbts_id}=                                    admin_info_model.get_mrbts_id_admin
    ...                                             connection=${connection}

    Create Selenium Session                         admin_connection=${connection}
    webui.load_commissioning_file_and_check_load_status
    ...                                             file_path=${scf_path}
    webui.set_parameter_value                       dist_name=MRBTS-${mrbts_id}/MNL-1/AMGR-1/LUAC-1
    ...                                             filter_param=Allow local user default password
    ...                                             abbr=allowLocalUserDefaultPassword
    ...                                             new_value=true
    ...                                             bts_configuration=CONF-1_${scf_path.split("/")[-1].split(".")[0]}
    ...                                             timeout=240
    webui.validate_plan
    ${activation_succeded}                          webui.activate_plan
    ...                                             activate_plan_despite_errors=${True}
    ...                                             timeout=240
    wait until keyword succeeds                     15min
    ...                                             5 sec
    ...                                             Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs

    [Teardown]                                      Close Selenium Session

Allow Fault 4795
    [Arguments]                                     ${bts_type}
    Alarms.Allow alarm                              fault_id=4795
    ...                                             alarm_id=7116
    ...                                             severity=Critical
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

Disallow Fault 4795
    [Arguments]                                     ${bts_type}
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                           fault_id=4795
    ...                                             alarm_id=7116
    ...                                             severity=Critical
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

Enable Radio Marking Feature
    [Arguments]                                     ${sw_stream}
    Run Keyword If                                  "${sw_stream}" > "SBTS24R3"
    ...                                             Set actRadioSecMarking Value
    ...                                             value=MCC and MNC
    ...                                             ELSE
    ...                                             Set tmpParam2 Value
    ...                                             value=2

Disable Radio Marking Feature
    [Arguments]                                     ${sw_stream}
    Run Keyword If                                  "${sw_stream}" > "SBTS24R3"
    ...                                             Set actRadioSecMarking Value
    ...                                             value=Disabled

Verify RMODs And Cells Statuses After Security Feature Activation
